    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `aggregate_metric_stats.py` that retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific service. For this task, I will use the Google Analytics API, which is a concrete external provider that offers aggregated statistics over time windows. I will import the necessary Google Analytics API client library and use it to fetch the data. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862477892,
          "start": 1789862474451
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1df2d3001EAXSy32wp6zpcu",
