    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that queries recent data points for a named metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that allows querying metrics over a specified time window. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use it to interact with CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862471038,
          "start": 1789862467955
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1dd9730016ymXUeUi5dZsSO",
